  "solution": "Concept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a05c09ab057604093d82454a8ea355aa24267df6fa6739b5d1d234c330e67ef8.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n74 + 88 ÷ 8 × 10 of 5 - 90 ÷ 15 + {44 - (108 ÷ 12)}\n\n⇒ 74 + 88 ÷ 8 × 10 of 5 - 90 ÷ 15 + {44 - 9}\n\n⇒ 74 + 11 × 10 × 5 - 90 ÷ 15 + 35\n\n⇒ 74 + 550 - 6 + 35\n\n⇒ 659 - 6\n\n= 653\n\n**∴ Value is 653**",
